# Optional. An external host for gift icons and pack artwork. Takes priority over the local
# `public/art/` drawings when set; unset (the default) uses those, then the game icons and pack
# images under `public/icons/`, and where neither has a picture the tile is an empty box (no
# fallback glyph — the name beside it says which gift or pack it is).
#
# **Game artwork is not committed to this repository** — it belongs to Project Moon — except the
# gift icons, keyword icons and pack images listed in NOTICE. What lives under `public/art/` is
# original work by this repository's owner, which is why it can ship here.
# VITE_ASSET_BASE=https://assets.example.com
